:"A rebel chieftain of Donglai. Meticulous in thought and reserved in wisdom, she was adept at planning and strategic disposition. Finding a kindred spirit in her fellow villager Zheng Qi, the two became sworn lifelong companions, with Jiang Yun serving as Zheng Qi's most trusted right hand and deputy. Later, when the imperial court launched a massive campaign to encircle and suppress them on multiple fronts, the tide had already turned. Though Jiang Yun made every effort to maneuver, deploy, and hold out, she was powerless to reverse their fate. In the end, she gave her life alongside her sworn sister Zheng Qi, and their rebel faction was wiped out.","jp":"東莱の渠帥。思慮深く、知略は内向的で、策謀や布石を得意とした。同郷の鄭萁と意気投合して生死を共にする契りを結び、鄭萁が最も信頼を寄せる腹心にして副手となった。その後、朝廷が大軍を発して多方面から包囲・討伐に乗り出すと大勢は決し、姜芸は手を尽くして采配を振り、奔走して防戦に努めたものの、なおも形勢を覆すことはできなかった。最後は義姉妹である鄭萁とともに身を捨てて義に殉じ、義勇兵勢力は壊滅した。","kr":"동래의 거수이다. 생각이 치밀하고 지계가 내성적이며, 계책을 도모하고 포석을 짜는 데 능했다. 동향인 정기와 뜻이 통해 생사를 함께하는 벗이 되었고, 정기가 가장 신뢰하는 오른팔이자 부관이 되었다. 이후 조정이 대대적으로 군사를 일으켜 여러 방면에서 포위 토벌해 오자 대세는 이미 기울었으니, 강운이 백방으로 군을 조율하며 분주히 수비에 힘썼으나 끝내 형세를 되돌릴 수는 없었다. 결국 의자매인 정기와 함께 목숨을 바쳐 의를 지켰으며, 의군 세력은 궤멸되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1051715","remark":"","surname":"姜","surnameTc":"姜","surnameEn":"Jiang","surnameJp":"姜","surnameKr":"강","surnameOther":"","name":"芸","nameTc":"蕓","nameEn":"Yun","nameJp":"芸","nameKr":"운","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"姜芸","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"190","city":"CS1070","gender":"1","rule":"63","force":"78","wise":"79","politics":"67","charm":"81","will":"88","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"6","wiseTalent":"11","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"12","weaponMaster":"34/47/78/36/38/33/43/33","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1